  "summary": "Promote the corrected OD-012 policy into canonical graph revision 13.",
  "why": "The operator replacement requires current design and program projections plus immutable correction evidence. Revision 13 preserves the original baseline object, creates an R2 object with a supersedes edge, separates root-source retention from transitive build inputs, and records the deterministic double-build and wheel-only runtime boundaries. The operator-authorized rdflib 7.6.0 development pin, mechanically rebound GraphRecipe report, and standards-based hard test are recorded here before OVR-000063 verifies their bytes. The original CC-D12 card and evidence are intentionally not revised."
